**Day 28 of the Claude Code Challenge 🚀**

Today I built a **Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator**—an interactive application that demonstrates the coordination required before a patient can be admitted to the hospital.

From documentation and insurance verification to prior authorization, utilization review, and care team coordination, every step plays a critical role in ensuring a smooth admission process.

**Key takeaways:**
✅ Understand hospital admission workflows
✅ Learn how documentation, insurance, and prior authorization affect patient care
✅ Identify operational and clinical risks before admission
✅ Build interactive healthcare workflow simulations with AI using Claude

It's impressive how AI can transform complex healthcare operations into engaging, hands-on learning experiences that are far more effective than static documentation.

